# Activities — /api/activities
#
# Run `dotnet run --project JsonApiPoc` first, then click the gutter icon next to a request.
# `###` separates requests; the text after it is the request name. "->" notes the expected outcome.
#
# Seed: 1 call "Discovery call with Jan"      (deal 1, contact 1)
#       2 email "Send proposal draft"         (deal 1, no contact)
#       3 meeting "Pilot kickoff"             (deal 2, contact 3)
#       4 task "Prepare renewal quote"        (deal 3, contact 4, completed)
#       5 task "Quarterly CRM data cleanup"   (NO deal, NO contact — both to-ones empty)
# Kinds: call | email | meeting | task. Activities are read-only; there are no write endpoints.

@host = http://localhost:5031

### List activities
GET {{host}}/api/activities
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### With their deal and contact side-loaded (compound document)
GET {{host}}/api/activities?include=deal,contact
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Sorted by due date, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/activities?sort=-dueAt
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Sorted by kind, then due date
GET {{host}}/api/activities?sort=kind,dueAt
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Second page of 2 -> links.prev/next, meta.total
GET {{host}}/api/activities?page[number]=2&page[size]=2
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Sparse fieldsets across all three types
GET {{host}}/api/activities?include=deal,contact&fields[activities]=subject,dueAt,deal,contact&fields[deals]=title&fields[contacts]=lastName
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Single activity with both relationships side-loaded
GET {{host}}/api/activities/1?include=deal,contact
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Missing activity -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/activities/999
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Following the hypermedia links. Both relationships are optional to-ones, so
# both can legitimately answer with data: null rather than a 404.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Related resource: an activity's deal (links.related)
GET {{host}}/api/activities/1/deal
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Relationship linkage: just the resource identifier (links.self)
GET {{host}}/api/activities/1/relationships/deal
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### An activity's contact
GET {{host}}/api/activities/1/contact
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### An activity's contact linkage
GET {{host}}/api/activities/1/relationships/contact
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### The related deal, trimmed with a sparse fieldset
GET {{host}}/api/activities/1/deal?fields[deals]=title,stage
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Empty to-one related resource -> 200 with data: null (activity 5 has no deal; not a 404)
GET {{host}}/api/activities/5/deal
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Empty to-one linkage -> 200 with data: null
GET {{host}}/api/activities/5/relationships/contact
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Relationship on a missing parent -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/activities/999/relationships/deal
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Query validation -> 400 problem details
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Unsupported sort field -> 400 (detail lists dueAt, kind)
GET {{host}}/api/activities?sort=subject
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Unsupported include path -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/activities?include=company
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Activities expose no filters -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/activities?filter[kind]=call
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Unknown query parameter -> 400 (strict validation)
GET {{host}}/api/activities?foo=bar
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Paging a single-resource endpoint -> 400 (only collections paginate)
GET {{host}}/api/activities/1?page[number]=2
Accept: application/vnd.api+json
